catalog/sources.jsonl lists titles and URLs taken from free-programming-books
(https://github.com/EbookFoundation/free-programming-books), licensed CC BY 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), and the official documentation of the tools
listed in catalog/config.json. Only those facts (title, URL, section, stated licence) are
reproduced; the commit and fetch date are in catalog/meta.json.

No text or code was copied from the books, manuals and pages the catalog lists. Every explanation
and every example under skills/ and dataset/ was written for this repository and checked by
running it; the sources are cited by catalog ID.
